      178.65,
      362.89,
      423.22,
      373.96
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE A MEMBER OF THE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      115.29,
      373.93,
      486.33,
      408.28
    ],
    "text": "PUTTALAM URBAN COUNCILUNDER SECTION 65A(2) OF THELOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BY",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      152.25,
      408.97,
      449.37,
      420.04
    ],
    "text": "LOCAL AUTHORITIES (SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, No 30 OF 2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      442.09,
      485.66,
      453.16
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of a member in Puttalam Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of resignation;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      463.93,
      546.62,
      508.12
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of the recognized political part namely United National Freedom Alliance to which theformer Member, Mohamed Nizar Mohamed Nazmi belonged, was required by me under Section 65A(2) of the aforesaidOrdinance, to nominate within a period of thirty (30) days a person eligible under the Ordinance for election as a member ofthat Puttalam Urban Council who shall be declared elected as a member ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      520.33,
      546.58,
      543.16
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political part has nominated Mr. Mohamed AbubuckerSadureen being an eligble person under the aforesaid Ordinance to fill such vacancy;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      553.93,
      546.62,
      598.12
    ],
    "text": "Now therefore, I, Pakkiyarajah Ragunathan Returning Officer of the Puttalam Urban Council, acting in terms ofSection 65A(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance as amended by Filling of Vacancies in Local Authorities (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 30 of 2013 (Chapter 262) do hereby declare Mr. Mohamed Abubucker Sadureen elected as a member ofthe Puttalam Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      422.73,
      598.09,
      533.71,
      609.16
    ],
    "text": "PAKKIYARAJAH RAGUNATHAN,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      608.89,
      526.42,
      664.12
    ],
    "text": "Returning Officer,Puttalam Urban Council.Elections Office,Puttalam,27th January 2015.",
